    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Horan Estates are delighted to present 2 Mayeston Rise, Saint Margaret's Road, Dublin 11 to the market — a truly impressive and beautifully maintained three-bedroom townhouse set within the highly sought-after Mayeston development. Offering generous and well-proportioned accommodation across two floors, this exceptional home stands out for its stunning rear garden, covered decking area, private balcony and en-suite master bedroom — a combination that is hard to find in this price range.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation is both spacious and practical, comprising a welcoming entrance hall with staircase, a large and bright living room with feature fireplace, a generous open-plan kitchen and dining area with access to the rear garden, a downstairs bathroom and a useful storage closet. The kitchen is well fitted with modern units and benefits from French doors that open directly onto the covered decking area and beautifully landscaped rear garden — a real highlight of the property, thoughtfully planted with mature trees, flowering shrubs and a charming garden shed. Upstairs, three well-proportioned bedrooms are served by a spacious landing, with the master bedroom benefitting from a private en-suite shower room, built-in wardrobes and excellent light. A second bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, and one bedroom also enjoys access to a private balcony with open views.\r\n\r\nMayeston is a most sought-after development of homes offering large open spaces and greens adjacent to a host of local amenities, including Finglas Village, excellent catchment for both primary and secondary schools, parks and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none with all amenities close by:\r\n\r\n3 min drive to Charlestown Shopping Centre including Odeon Cinema\r\nWalking distance to IKEA and Decathlon\r\n10 min drive to Dublin Airport\r\n10 min drive to DCU and the Helix entertainment venue\r\n20 min to Dublin City Centre on the 140 bus route\r\nLIDL, ALDI, Pharmacy, SPAR and more in the immediate vicinity\r\nBus routes No. 19, E2, 140 and 155 providing frequent connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas\r\nM50, M1 and Port Tunnel within close proximity — ideal for commuters\r\n\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious and move-in ready family home in one of Dublin 11's most popular and well-connected developments.\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, furniture, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only. Furniture shown is for representation purposes only; please consult the estate agent to confirm what will remain in the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall – 10.72 m² (5.03 × 5.69) | Carpet flooring, staircase to first floor, storage closet\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 17.74 m² (3.70 × 5.18) | Bright and spacious, feature fireplace, carpet flooring, large window to front\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room – 17.05 m² (5.03 × 4.35) | Modern fitted kitchen with floor and wall units, tiled flooring, French doors to rear garden and decking\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.60 m² (1.75 × 1.48) | Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, shower\r\n\r\nCloset – 1.37 m² | Useful storage\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding – 8.42 m² (3.99 × 3.39) | Carpet flooring, attic access, access to all rooms\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master) – 14.53 m² (5.01 × 3.40) | Large double bedroom, carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, en-suite shower room\r\n\r\nEn-Suite – 2.18 m² (1.62 × 1.48) | WC, wash hand basin, shower enclosure\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 10.98 m² (2.72 × 4.32) | Double bedroom, carpet flooring, balcony access\r\n\r\nBalcony – 2.21 m² (2.72 × 0.81)\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 6.99 m² (2.15 × 3.33) | Single/small double, carpet flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom – 3.28 m² | Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, bath\r\n\r\nCloset – 0.73 m²\r\n\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: approximately 92 m² (excluding balcony)"
